      "Can I drive on my foreign licence with a UAE residence visa?",
      "No. Once a UAE residence visa is issued, a foreign licence and an International Driving Permit both stop being accepted for driving, however much validity remains on them. A UAE driving licence becomes compulsory, and there is no grace period built into the rule - which is why it is worth starting the conversion or the driving course before the visa lands rather than after."
